# Cookie Consent Rules (3 Rules)

## 45. Cookie Banner
Categories: Necessary (always on), Analytics, Marketing, Preferences. Banner on first visit.

## 46. GTM Consent Mode v2
Denied by default. GTM/GA4 blocked before consent. Fire only after consent.

## 47. Regional Compliance
Strict opt-in for EU/UK. Notice-only acceptable for US. Check with client.
